\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.2}{\ignorespaces Top-2 beam prediction accuracy as a function of the number of real target-domain samples, for all four Stage~2 models across all four comparisons, with the 12.5\% random-chance reference line for a 16-class problem.}}{46}{figure.caption.23}%
